e image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Pact_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Pact Weapon\">Bind Pact Weapon</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>PACT_BLADE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hexed_Weapon\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\">Hexed Weapon</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with it.</li>\n<li>The weapon's damage is magical and uses the warlock's <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.</li>\n<li>When the warlock attacks with this weapon, there is a chance that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a> will be applied to the target.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Pact_Weapon\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Pact Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condit